                <pb facs="0771" n="721" sameAs="frus:frus1919Parisv12/pg721"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">Paris Peace Conf. 181.9202/247: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">General Bandholtz to the Commission to Negotiate
                        Peace</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Budapest</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1919-11-15">November 15, 1919</date>.<lb/>[Received November
                        15—10:40 a.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>203. Polk from Bandholtz. Evacuation of Budapest by Roumanians and reoccupation
                    by Hungarians accomplished without noteworthy incident. Shall return key to
                    museum this date. Is report correct that Ammission closes temporarily or
                    permanently at end of November?</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Bandholtz</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
